*    RXVM@INS
*    RXVM@REM
*    RXVM@SWA
*    RIRST&TYPE
*    RXVM@LIN
*    VSNPRINT

GENMOD RXC&DEBUG ( FROM RXCPMAI@

&TYPE RXC&DEBUG -V
RXC&DEBUG -V
COPY RXC&DEBUG MODULE A = = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
COPY LOAD MAP A RXC&DEBUG = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
ERASE * TEXT A
ERASE RXC&DEBUG MODULE A
ERASE LOAD MAP A

&EXIT 0
